..\\r...Waaaaaaah!\\nYou’re mean!\\rYou shouldn’t be so serious!\\nYou...you child, you!","msg_0582_T25GYM0101_00002":"Whitney: Waaaaah!\\rWaaaaah!\\r...Snivel, hic.\\n...You meanie!","msg_0582_T25GYM0101_00003":"Whitney: Sniff...\\rWhat? What do you want? A Badge?\\rOh, right. I forgot.\\nHere’s the Plain Badge.\\r","msg_0582_T25GYM0101_00004":"{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} received\\nthe Plain Badge from Whitney.","msg_0582_T25GYM0101_00005":"Whitney: The Plain Badge lets your\\nPokémon use Strength outside\\fof battle.\\rOh, you can have this, too!\\r","msg_0582_T25GYM0101_00006":"","msg_0582_T25GYM0101_00007":"Whitney: It’s Attract!\\nIt makes full use of a Pokémon’s charm.\\rIsn’t it just perfect for a cutie\\nlike me?\\fThat’s right!\\rI heard that this thing called the\\nPokéathlon Dome is now open right next\\fto the National Park.\\rYou should go try it, since you’re\\nso good at battling with your Pokémon!","msg_0582_T25GYM0101_00008":"Whitney: Ah, that was a good cry!\\rCome for a visit again! Bye-bye!","msg_0582_T25GYM0101_00009":"Oh, no. You made Whitney cry.\\rIt’s OK. She’ll stop soon.\\nShe always cries when she loses.\\r","msg_0582_T25GYM0101_00010":"Yo! Champ in the making!\\rThis Gym is home to Normal-type\\nPokémon Trainers.\\rI recommend you use Fighting-type\\nPokémon.","msg_0582_T25GYM0101_00011":"You won? Great! I was busy admiring\\nthe powerful Trainers here.","msg_0582_T25GYM0101_00012":"Goldenrod City Pokémon Gym","msg_0582_T25GYM0101_00013":"Goldenrod City Pokémon Gym\\rLeader: Whitney\\nCertified Trainer!\\f{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}"},"initTriggers":[],"initScripts":{"OnTransition":"_EV_scr_seq_T25GYM0101_004 + 1"},"constants":{"_EV_scr_seq_T25GYM0101_000":0,"_EV_scr_seq_T25GYM0101_001":1,"_EV_scr_seq_T25GYM0101_002":2,"_EV_scr_seq_T25GYM0101_003":3,"_EV_scr_seq_T25GYM0101_004":4,"obj_T25GYM0101_gsleader3":0,"obj_T25GYM0101_gsgirl1":1,"obj_T25GYM0101_gsgirl1_2":2,"obj_T25GYM0101_gswoman2":3,"obj_T25GYM0101_gswoman2_2":4,"obj_T25GYM0101_sunglasses":5}}
